  <dc:creator>The Apache Software Foundation</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>Lucene.Net is a full-text search engine library capable of advanced text analysis, indexing, and searching. It can be used to easily add search capabilities to applications. Lucene.Net is a C# port of the popular Java Lucene search engine framework from The Apache Software Foundation, targeted at .NET Framework and .NET Core users.</dc:description>
  <dc:identifier>Lucene.Net</dc:identifier>
